DESCRIPTION:Mindful Meet & Mingle – Asheville Singles\n**The Relationshi
 p Reset Retreat: Becoming Secure in Love**\nA 3 Day Virtual Experience for
  Women Ready to Stop\nRepeating Relationship Patterns and Build Lasting\, 
 Secure Love with **7+ practitioners from around the world**\n\n\\|October 
 16 to 18\\\, 2026\n\\|Live Online\n\\|Completely Free\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\>\\*\\*\\*Join With The Link Below\\*\\*\\*<\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\n\n[https://allevents.systeme.io/relationshipresetevent](https://al
 levents.systeme.io/relationshipresetevent?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e0_tv4_a1dem
 oo4cxe91x&fbclid=IwcGRvZgVleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFUOVEwUGhEajhKcDZHUWlWc3J
 0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHtrjCtRzeIlDgU6gaTfArY6gE-GRYJf06hLF3
 muXmi-VEW5zSVWf6Ig0a395_aem_2gnpYpsW9YPMQbpMrxnsvA)\n\n**You know that fee
 ling when you've done the work...**\nYou've read the books.\nYou've listen
 ed to the podcasts.\nYou've promised yourself this relationship would be d
 ifferent.\nAnd yet somehow\, you still find yourself caught in familiar pa
 tterns.\nOverthinking every text.\nQuestioning how someone feels about you
 .\nStaying too long when something doesn't feel right.\nGiving more than y
 ou're receiving.\nKnowing what you need\, but struggling to trust yourself
  enough to act on it.\n\n*You may understand your patterns better than eve
 r before.*\nBut understanding them doesn't always mean you know how to cha
 nge them.\nThat's where becoming secure comes in.\n\nThe Relationship Rese
 t Retreat was created for women who are ready to move beyond simply unders
 tanding their relationship patterns and begin creating something different
 .\n\n* A relationship that feels safe in your body.\n* A relationship wher
 e you can trust yourself.\n* A relationship where you can communicate your
  needs\, hold healthy boundaries\, receive love\, and stay connected to yo
 urself while being deeply connected to someone else.\n\nThis is not about 
 becoming perfect at relationships.\nIt's about learning how to feel more s
 ecure within yourself so you can create healthier\, more fulfilling connec
 tions.\n\nOver three days\, you'll join an incredible group of women and e
 xperienced practitioners for honest conversations\, practical tools\, refl
 ection\, and opportunities to experience what secure connection can actual
 ly feel like.\n\n**We'll explore topics including:**\n\n* Understanding yo
 ur attachment patterns\n* Breaking cycles that keep showing up in relation
 ships\n* Learning to recognize the difference between attraction and align
 ment\n* Building trust in yourself and your inner wisdom\n* Creating healt
 hy boundaries without shutting people out\n* Learning how to receive inste
 ad of always over functioning\n* Understanding your nervous system and the
  role of co regulation\n* Communicating your needs with more confidence\n*
  Becoming more comfortable with emotional intimacy\n* Recognizing emotiona
 lly available relationships\n* Moving from anxious patterns toward greater
  security\n* Creating relationships that feel safe\, connected\, and recip
 rocal\n\n**This retreat is for you if you're tired of...**\nSecond guessin
 g yourself\nFeeling stuck when it comes to love.\nOverthinking every messa
 ge\nQuestioning how someone feels about you\n\n**Three Days of Connection 
 and Wisdom**\n\n* Friday Evening\n\nWe'll begin by creating space to slow 
 down\, connect\, and become aware of the patterns that may be shaping your
  relationships.\n\n* Saturday\n\nA full day of conversations\, teachings\,
  practices\, and connection focused on becoming more secure in love.\n\n* 
 Sunday Morning\n\nWe'll come together to integrate what you've learned and
  explore how you can carry these shifts into your everyday life and future
  relationships.\n\n**This is a live online experience\, so you can join fr
 om wherever you are.**\n**Come as you are.**\n\nBring your questions\, you
 r experiences\, your curiosity\, and your willingness to look at love in a
  new way.\n\nThe Relationship Reset Retreat is completely free because we 
 believe this kind of support should be accessible to women who are ready f
 or something different.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\>\\*\\*\\*Join With T
 he Link Below\\*\\*\\*<\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n[https://allevents.s
 ysteme.io/relationshipresetevent](https://allevents.systeme.io/relationshi
 presetevent?utm_id=97758_v0_s00_e0_tv4_a1demoo4cxe91x&fbclid=IwcGRvZgVleHR
 uA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFUOVEwUGhEajhKcDZHUWlWc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwM
