 npYpsW9YPMQbpMrxnsvA)\n\nJoin us October 16 to 18 for three days of connec
 tion\, reflection\, learning\, and becoming more secure in love.\nYour rel
 ationship patterns are not your destiny.\nYou can learn a different way.\n
 And you don't have to do it alone.
